message: "Cite the repository as 'one-field', with the Octavian Coherence Gate paper (doi 10.5281/zenodo.20493955)."
title: "one-field: the Standard Model constant table from the E_8(1) > G_2(1) x F_4(1) interference web"
abstract: "Executable derivation of the Standard Model constant table, gravity, and the dark sector from a recursive interference web. interference/wiring.py generates the web's dictionary and its Planck scale channel coupling. The mixing maps are identifications. G is the anchor inversion read through the common mode, G M_b^2 = 3 Q_l - 1. The induced gravity ledger fixes the sign and the Planck order of the stiffness. A particle persists by closure: in the empty field it is a lump that carries one quantum of circulation, protected by the conserved charge and angular momentum."
